{"page_id": "rotation_skew-rse3bb77cb_rot270-p1", "markdown": "Page 9610 of 10444\n\nFrom:\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\n@uscp.gov>\n\nDate: January 1, 2021 at 10:02:05 PM EST\n\nTo: (b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nCIDIi\n\n(b)(6);\n\nThv7vC\n\n@usss.dhs.gov>\n\nSubject: 12.30.20\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nGood evening (h17Y\n\nDo, Hope you enjoyed a happy and healthy new year. Below please find a\n\nreport submitted to the FBI for your visibility:\n\n--New iSalute Message--\n\nTime of Submission: 2020/12/30 05:00:32\n\nCategory: Other (Informational Information)\n\nDescription: Hello my name is Sergeant\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C) and I am a DACP Desk Sergeant with the Ft. Leonard Wood Military Police. And during my shift I received a phone call at\n\nthe Military Police Desk from a\n\n(b)(6I; (b)(7)(C)\n\nHe was wanting to report that he had a hunch that on January 6, 2021 that there would be a chemical or biological attack in a water reservoir in Washington D.C. and that there should be extra security at the\n\ninauguration. I would like to make sure that this gets reported/known.\n\n.--Submitter Information-.\n\nFirst Name:\n\n(b)(6);\n\nMiddle Name:\n\n(b)(6);\n\nLast Name:\n\n(b)(7)(C) Citizenship: Citizen\n\nPrimary Phone:\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nPrimary Phone Type: Cellular\n\nAlternate Phone:\n\nAlternate Phone Type:\n\nCity/Base: FT. Leonard Wood\n\nState/Country: Missouri\n\nEmail Address:\n\nSpecial Agent\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nUnited States Capitol Police\n\nCriminal Investigations Section\n\nFBI Cyber Task Force Officer\n\nOffice:\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nPrimary\n\n(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)\n\nAlternate\n\n(b)(6);\n\n@uscp.gov\n\n@fbi.gov", "width": 2200, "height": 1700, "blocks": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Page 9610 of 10444", "bbox": {"x": 3.2, "y": 760.5, "width": 22.4, "height": 175.79999999999995}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "From:", "bbox": {"x": 203.2, "y": 1333.9, "width": 35.0, "height": 86.70000000000005}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(b)(6); (b)(7)(C)", "bb